#: ../../../../../Wrapping/Python/vtkmodules/util/data_model.py:709
msgid ""
"The peer of ``point_data`` and ``cell_data`` for data that lives on a cell's "
"boundary rather than at its centre or corners -- the flux or the normal "
"component of velocity through a side, say.  A side shared by two cells has "
"one id and so one tuple, which both cells read; the sign from "
"``GetSideMap().GetSideOrientation()`` says which way is outward for a given "
"cell.  A 3D cell's sides are its faces and a 2D cell's are its edges, so "
"this works on surface meshes too."
msgstr ""

